pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.68.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">October 4th, 2024</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p><p>The hardened Moon Rod is a rod obtained in the <a href=\"/wiki/The_Monstrous_Manor\" title=\"The Monstrous Manor\">The Monstrous Manor</a> on top of the hill near <a href=\"/wiki/The_Oak_Depot\" title=\"The Oak Depot\">The Oak Depot</a>. It can be purchased for 10,250 <a href=\"/wiki/Candy\" title=\"Candy\">Candy</a>. The Hardened Moon Rod is located on the second floor, on the lap of one of the mannequins at the couch and chairs. It can be used to craft the 3 <a href=\"/wiki/Tools\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Tools\">Tools</a> from the 2024 halloween event and the 7 tools from the 2025 Halloween event\n</p>\n<table class=\"fandom-table\">\n<caption>Crafting recipes\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Moon_Shard\" title=\"Moon Shard\">Moon Shard</a>\n</th>\n<th>Result\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Waxing Crescent Moon Shard\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Astral_Saw\" title=\"Astral Saw\">Astral Saw</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>First Quarter Moon Shard\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Crater_Chisel\" title=\"Crater Chisel\">Crater Chisel</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Waxing Gibbous Moon Shard\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Heavenly_Pollaxe\" title=\"Heavenly Pollaxe\">Heavenly Pollaxe</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Full Moon Shard\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Lunar_Staff\" title=\"Lunar Staff\">Lunar Staff</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Waning Gibbous Moon Shard\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Celestial_Hammer\" title=\"Celestial Hammer\">Celestial Hammer</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Third Quarter Moon Shard\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Eclipse_Crossbow\" title=\"Ec